  ABLATION SCHEME: mean
====================================================================================

  Ablated nodes are replaced by their mean activation.

  Read the three evaluations differently under this scheme:
    sanity / null  fill the COMPLEMENT of a ~0.7%-of-model circuit, i.e.
                   they mean-ablate ~99.3% of the model. That is the
                   standard (much harsher) faithfulness measure, and it
                   will not reproduce the in-run interchange numbers.
    knockout       fills the circuit itself — ~0.7% of the model.

